{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>PDF Scanner Document Convert + 是一款結合掃描、編輯、簽署與閱讀 PDF 的手機工具，適合需要隨時處理文件、收據、筆記、名片、合約與表單的商務人士、學生及個人用戶。原價 US $49.99，現時終生版<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，可把握機會領取。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-41.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>掃描編輯簽署閱讀一應俱全</h2>\n<p>此應用可透過手機相機掃描文件、收據、筆記與名片，自動偵測邊緣、提升清晰度。用戶可即時編輯 PDF 文字、加入高亮、形狀與註解，或建立及儲存數碼簽名，直接在合約、表格與協議上簽署。閱讀時可自訂檢視模式，支援縮放、搜尋與頁面導覽，適合工作、學習及個人使用；文件儲存在裝置內，兼顧私隱與安全。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-33-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-34-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-35-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1284x2778bb-36-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>PDF Scanner Document Convert + 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PDF Scanner Document Convert +</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/pdf-scanner-document-convert/id6753771856\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T22:01:08.155505+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":479,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T21:41:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T20:58:35.699885+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T21:58:57.383915+00:00","content_hash":"79425b5c9d1a5b9647f33ef91dd7dd5649cc57a740e05a0658575cd795dd7d63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}